# Data Dictionary: MMR Rooftop Solar Survey

This codebook maps the raw survey questions from `survey_responses_anonymized.csv` to their corresponding analytical variables.

| Variable Name | Original Survey Question | Data Type |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Consent** | Do you consent to participate in this academic survey? | Boolean (Yes/No) |
| **Housing_Type** | What type of residence do you currently live in? | Categorical |
| **CHS_Adoption** | Does your building society currently have a rooftop solar panel system installed... | Categorical |
| **CHS_Bill** | What is your household's average monthly electricity bill? | Ordinal (Billing Slabs) |
| **CHS_Barrier** | What do you think is the primary reason your housing society has NOT installed... | Categorical |
| **CHS_Awareness** | Are you aware of the government's "PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana"... | Categorical |
| **CHS_Willingness** | Would you be willing to sign a petition urging your housing society to install... | Categorical |
| **Ind_Adoption** | Do you currently have a rooftop solar panel system installed at your residence? | Boolean (Yes/No) |
| **Ind_Bill** | What is your average monthly electricity bill? | Ordinal (Billing Slabs) |
| **Ind_Barrier** | What is the primary reason you have NOT installed solar panels? | Categorical |
| **Ind_Awareness** | Are you aware of the government's "PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana"... | Categorical |
| **Ind_Readiness** | If a cost-benefit analysis proved that a solar system would pay for itself... | Categorical |

*Note: Personally Identifiable Information (PII) including emails, names, and phone numbers have been stripped from this public dataset to protect respondent privacy.*
